{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overall Introduction</strong><br>\u00b7 <i>&quot;ShuXian Chronicles: Idle Ascension&quot;</i> is an idle loot-based RPG with turn-based cultivation themes.<br>\u00b7 Compared to similar games, this title offers significantly expanded strategic depth and breadth in character building.<br>\u00b7 Systems like equipment forging, affixes, artifacts, immortal beast taming, breeding, and alchemy will deliver lottery-like excitement and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Formation</strong><br>\u00b7 Collect over 30 unique Immortal Companions, each valued at 1-6 Destiny Points.<br>\u00b7 Assemble your 2-8 member adventure party within a 10-point Destiny limit.<br>\u00b7 Whether prioritizing quality or quantity becomes your strategic choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Crafting</strong><br>\u00b7 Clear chapters and idle-farm materials to forge divine weapons.<br>\u00b7 Every crafted weapon has randomly generated rarity, stats, and affixes - no two are alike.<br>\u00b7 Unique affix system: Equipments only activate special effects when reaching 5/10/15 points of the same affix type across all gear. Your build strategy matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Refinement</strong><br>\u00b7 Unlock faction-exclusive artifacts by completing chapters.<br>\u00b7 Each artifact develops distinct evolutionary paths during refinement, creating varied combat strategies.<br>\u00b7 With 2 artifact slots per companion, optimal combinations have no standard solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Systems (Capture/Breeding/Fusion)</strong><br>\u00b7 No cultivation world is complete without mythical beasts!<br>\u00b7 Each chapter features faction-specific beasts - capture their eggs from defeated foes.<br>\u00b7 Hatched beasts have randomized aptitudes and growth values.<br>\u00b7 Train exceptional beasts with powerful skills to enhance combat performance.<br>\u00b7 Through &quot;Beast Fusion&quot;, create superior hybrids with enhanced stats and more skill slots - including rare hidden variants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Systems</strong><br>\u00b7 <i>Ore Refining</i>: All immortal gems require raw ore purification.<br>\u00b7 <i>Alchemy</i>: Convert excess materials into probability-boosting elixirs and stat-enhancing pills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover more wonders in the world of <i>ShuXian Chronicles</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official QQ Groups:<br>1\ufe0f\u20e3 Group-664520002</p>","achievements":{"highlight